<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5482/5492.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5482/5492.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5482/5492 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Wednesday will be 5487.</p>
<p>On Monday the bid/offer rates were 5481/5491, with the official dollar rate 5486 from Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5385/5985 after 5383/5983.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
